            ^"Combat" STRING """Axe and Round Shield (unmounted): Init +2, Attack +16, Defense +12, Damage +6
Axe and Round Shield (mounted): Init +2, Attack +19, Defense +15, Damage +6"""
            ^"Soak" STRING "+9"
